Package: picompose-core
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 cron,
 iproute2,
 systemd
Description: PiCompose base system
 The compose manager of PiCompose, the PipeWire and WirePlumber
 configuration for the Linux voice assistant and the hostname setup of the
 PiCompose image.
 .
 The compose manager deploys every Docker Compose project below /compose
 at boot and on a schedule. Docker itself and the PipeWire packages are not
 part of this package, the PiCompose image installs them.
